            <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s42256-026-01323-8</link>
            <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature Machine Intelligence, Published online: 02 November 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s42256-026-01323-8"&gt;doi:10.1038/s42256-026-01323-8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Artificial intelligence (AI) providers frequently update their models and system integrations without corresponding changes to their public identifiers. This undermines regulatory oversight and scientific reproducibility. We argue for meaningful AI versioning that meets the needs of regulators and researchers.</content:encoded>
            <dc:title>AI needs meaningful versioning</dc:title>
